      "name": "06 · Deliver settled results; recover carefully",
      "customData": {
        "slide": 6,
        "speakerNotes": "Workers can start before sealing. Delivery waits for sealing and terminal outcomes. An uncertain write stops immediately; only recorded safe read-only eligibility can permit one automatic retry per initiating request."
